Whale Skins: native Codex pet skin tooling.

Original plugin, package manager, documentation and tests: MIT.

plugins/whale-skins/vendor/hatch-pet is the hatch-pet pipeline distributed
with the OpenAI ChatGPT desktop application.
Its own LICENSE.txt applies (Apache License 2.0). The original skill,
scripts, references, and notices are retained in that directory. Two helpers
carry marked modifications: extract_strip_frames.py adds optional body-height
and baseline controls for shared-scale jump extraction, plus configurable
native-alpha component detection that preserves the original edge RGBA;
assemble_extended_atlas.py
preserves the registration of an already-normalized neutral cell.

The code license does not relicense user-supplied character art or third-party
reference images. The local Lanlan whale-maid preview is not part of this
public source repository. It is installed separately for the user's trial.

This project is independent and is not an official OpenAI or DeepSeek product.
